  "video_id": "whIo01ueHtc",
  "title": "Kronos launches free AI market model disrupting $30K Wall #kronosai #opensourceai #financialai",
  "description": "Kronos introduced an AI foundation model designed to interpret stock market data as a language. Developed by researchers from Tsinghua University, this open-source tool processes raw candlestick charts across over 45 global exchanges, including crypto, forex, and equities. Unlike traditional trading bots, Kronos tokenizes financial data similarly to how ChatGPT handles language, offering a novel approach to market analysis. The availability of such an advanced, free resource disrupts the market by providing access to technology previously valued at $30,000, reshaping trading analytics and strategy development. This innovation highlights the growing influence of AI in finance, democratizing access to sophisticated models and potentially transforming investment decisions and research globally. #KronosAI #TsinghuaUniversity #StockMarketAI #FinancialAI #TradingBot #AIinFinance #OpenSourceAI #MarketAnalysis #CryptoTrading #ForexAI #EquitiesAI #FinancialTechnology #AIInnovation #TradingTechnology #WallStreetTech",
